# The two play rules Nog's {3} gives him are abilities he gained (CR 613.1f): a "loses all abilities" effect with a later
# timestamp takes them (CR 613.7). Bot1 makes Nog a Ferengi Officer on turn 1, with Fabled Passage in the graveyard. In
# Bot1's turn-3 upkeep Bot2 casts Turn to Frog on him: that turn Fabled Passage is not offered from the graveyard, and after
# one Island the second is not offered. Turn to Frog ends with the turn, and the gained abilities with it don't: on turn 5
# Bot1 plays an Island and then Fabled Passage from the graveyard as the extra land.

